It is highly likely that the black-box function is a **complex, highly multimodal, and potentially rough or oscillatory function in 6 dimensions.** The optimization process successfully navigated several local minima to progressively find better objective values, eventually converging around -3.322, but consistently struggled with the presence of many attractive local optima.
